# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore, ci, build, perf
# Scope (optional): component/module affected (e.g., parser, core, docker)
# Subject: imperative mood, lowercase, no period, max 72 chars
#
# Body: Explain what and why (not how). Wrap at 72 characters.
#
# Footer: Reference issues, note breaking changes
#   - BREAKING CHANGE: describe incompatible changes
#   - Refs: #123, #456
#   - Co-Authored-By: Name <email@example.com>
#
# Examples:
#   feat(parser): add support for Swift lambdas
#   fix(java): resolve call stack depth calculation
#   docs: update README with Kotlin examples
#   ci: add conventional commit validation
#   feat(core)!: change error code format (BREAKING CHANGE)
